				"name": "impactSeeds.sides",
				"type": "Sides",
				"required": true,
				"description": "Base and head revisions (`ImpactSide`) whose only fields read are `config` and `manifests`; `revision`, `entries`, `scenarios` and `graph` are ignored. Only active manifests own changed files, while a changed unit manifest seeds its unit and that unit's owned files from both sides whatever their status.",
